{"about_the_game":"Outwith is an first person open world action rpg set in a medieval fantasy world.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a rich and complex world where your choices and alliances shape both the story and your surroundings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/83ee4e2090c4e30a9c1e2488aa344ee9.poster.avif?t=1769143210\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/83ee4e2090c4e30a9c1e2488aa344ee9.webm?t=1769143210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/83ee4e2090c4e30a9c1e2488aa344ee9.mp4?t=1769143210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in visceral bloody combat with relentless foes as you explore the unknown. Choose from melee, ranged or magic combat or any combination of these to develop your character and face the challenges that lie before you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/e2675ad5e7ff175e10193b5b2991d2f3.poster.avif?t=1769143210\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/e2675ad5e7ff175e10193b5b2991d2f3.webm?t=1769143210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183440/extras/e2675ad5e7ff175e10193b5b2991d2f3.mp4?t=1769143210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore soaring mountain peaks and delve into the deepest caverns to discover ancient secrets that have remained hidden for centuries.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Outwith Awaits...</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183440?t=176